{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;All one click&quot; is an Action-RPG that reduces player input to the most exciting part of every RPG: the level-up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kill monsters, collect XP, level up your character and climb the leaderboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You either choose actively what skills to take and upgrade or test your luck and let it choose randomly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be warned: every click counts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2588750/extras/2ae0bc1e0d8cad0551b6271bd8b34eda.poster.avif?t=1750754926\" width=800 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2588750/extras/2ae0bc1e0d8cad0551b6271bd8b34eda.webm?t=1750754926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2588750/extras/2ae0bc1e0d8cad0551b6271bd8b34eda.mp4?t=1750754926\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow &quot;Out of the Box Games&quot; on social media for regular updates.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2588750?t=1750754926","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2588750?t=1750754926","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2588750/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750754926","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2588750/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750754926","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sh